WEBVTT

00:07:28.716 --> 00:07:31.156
China’s leadership holds a clear view

00:07:31.196 --> 00:07:35.636
that the country must move away
from the “GDP-oriented” pattern

00:07:35.636 --> 00:07:37.396
that “pollutes, then treats,”

00:07:37.436 --> 00:07:40.196
to what it calls
an “ecological civilization.”

00:07:40.236 --> 00:07:44.436
Since 2010, China almost doubled
its GDP per capita

00:07:44.476 --> 00:07:48.276
while largely maintaining a steady level
of emissions per capita.

00:07:48.316 --> 00:07:49.476
And finally,

00:07:49.516 --> 00:07:54.236
let me give you just one example
of how this vision is implemented.

00:07:55.316 --> 00:07:56.716
In June 2021,

00:07:56.716 --> 00:07:58.316
China decided to clamp down hard

00:07:58.316 --> 00:08:01.516
on the power-hungry mining
of cryptocurrencies.